---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import FAQPageSchema from '../components/FAQPageSchema.astro';
import LocalBusinessSchema from '../components/LocalBusinessSchema.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';

const city = "South Orange";
const latitude = 40.7632;
const longitude = -74.2674;

const faqs = [
  { q: "How far is AllStar from South Orange?", a: "About 15 minutes via local roads and Route 78. 1166 West Chestnut St, Union. Free parking on-site." },
  { q: "What programs are available?", a: "Adult BJJ, Muay Thai, and MMA (ages 16+). Kids Lions (7–13) and Cubs (4–6). Summer camp runs seasonally." },
  { q: "Do I need experience?", a: "No. Most students — adults and kids — start with none." },
  { q: "Can I watch a class before enrolling my child?", a: "Yes. Walk in any time. We don't hide what we do." },
  { q: "What's the free trial?", a: "Two weeks of unlimited classes. Adults can try any program. Kids can try their age group. No card required, no contract, no pressure." },
  { q: "How do I start?", a: "Fill out the form on this page or call (908) 341-1131. We'll text to confirm a class time." },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="Martial Arts in South Orange, NJ — BJJ, Muay Thai & Kids Classes | AllStar"
  description="Martial arts classes for South Orange, NJ families at AllStar Martial Arts in Union. BJJ, Muay Thai, MMA, and Kids programs. Renzo Gracie black belt. Free 2-week trial."
  ogImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <LocalBusinessSchema city={city} latitude={latitude} longitude={longitude} />
    <FAQPageSchema faqs={faqs} />
  </Fragment>

  <PageHero
    eyebrow="15 minutes from South Orange"
    headline="Martial Arts in South Orange, NJ"
    sub="Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu, Muay Thai, MMA, and kids classes — about 15 minutes down local roads and Route 78 to Union. Free 2-week trial, no contract."
    bgImage="/images/adult-bjj-hero.jpg"
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
        South Orange is a train town — the Village, the arts center, Seton Hall, the reservation up the hill — and its families tend to look past the Essex County line for the right fit. AllStar sits about 15 minutes south, an easy pull down local roads and Route 78 to our facility at 1166 West Chestnut in Union, with free parking waiting. If you've also been eyeing options over in <a href="/maplewood/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Maplewood</a> or <a href="/millburn/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">Millburn</a>, it's worth the extra few minutes.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Here's why people make the drive: the coaching. Jamal Patterson is a Renzo Gracie black belt, ADCC veteran, and former professional MMA fighter who fought in the IFL and Bellator. That competition background reshapes how technique is taught — depth over demonstration. Students who've trained here five and ten years can point to exactly where it shows up.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- BJJ -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-gray-light">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">BJJ Classes Near South Orange, NJ</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu is our flagship program. Adults 16 and up, beginners very much included — most people start with zero background. The full rundown lives on our <a href="/adult-bjj/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">adult BJJ page</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Yes, other schools in the area teach BJJ, and a handful share our lineage. The difference is the coach. Jamal's competition resume — ADCC, IFL, Bellator, UWC champion — isn't a line on a flyer; it informs every technique he teaches.
      </p>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
        Evening classes at 6, 7, and 8 PM most weekdays, built around NJ Transit riders and working adults who commute into the city and back. Two weeks free. No contract.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Kids -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">Kids Martial Arts</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl text-brand-black mb-5">Kids Martial Arts Near South Orange, NJ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-gold">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Cubs — Ages 4–6</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Preschool-age energy with martial arts structure. Focus on coordination, listening, and confidence. Short activities, high engagement, constant positive reinforcement.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-gray-light p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-brand-navy">
          <h3 class="text-xl text-brand-black mb-2">Lions — Ages 7–13</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-gray text-sm leading-relaxed">Real Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu technique. Takedowns, escapes, positions. These kids are not doing karate katas — they're learning a system that works. Parents consistently report that the confidence carries into school.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-brand-gray leading-relaxed mt-5">
        Bully prevention is a real part of what South Orange parents come to us for. When a kid genuinely knows they can handle themselves, the dynamic with a bully changes without a single punch being thrown. Our <a href="/kids/" class="text-brand-navy font-bold hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors">kids program</a> is built around exactly that quiet confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Muay Thai + MMA -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-4xl">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">Muay Thai</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">Muay Thai Near South Orange, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            This is the one nobody else in the area offers. Across South Orange, Maplewood, and the Essex County side, you won't find authentic Muay Thai taught alongside real BJJ the way we do — actual pad work, actual technique, actual conditioning. Beginners are welcome.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow text-brand-gold">MMA</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">MMA Classes Near South Orange, NJ</h2>
          <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
            Our MMA program puts BJJ, Muay Thai, and wrestling together into one complete system, coached by Jamal Patterson — a pro MMA fighter who has cornered UFC athletes from their amateur debut to the pros. Adults 16 and up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Landmarks -->
  <section class="section-pad bg-white">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow">If you know South Orange</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-black mb-5">You Know These Spots — We're 15 Minutes Away</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {["Downtown South Orange", "South Orange Performing Arts Center", "Main Street", "Seton Hall University area", "South Orange Library", "South Mountain Reservation", "Maplewood border", "Route 78 corridor"].map((l) => (
          <span class="bg-brand-gray-light text-brand-gray px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">📍 {l}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FAQ items={faqs} />

  <CTA
    headline="Two Weeks Free — South Orange Families Welcome"
    sub="Show up. Bring water. We'll handle the rest. No commitment, no pressure."
  />
</PageLayout>
